entry.content:
get_screener: description  -field); +field; for a listing quoted in pence or cents, GBp/ZAc/ILA, it is in the major unit and market_cap_currency says which);
get_stock_activity: description  -filter. +filter; with no `types` its sum can exceed `total`, because the all-types list leaves out very weak news, shows a reported quarter once and lists upcoming dates separately.
get_stock_research: description  -90 +30 +filings[]: the latest SEC 8-K filings of the last 30 days, up to 3 (date, title, headline, summary, sentiment, items, sec_url). Empty when none in the window; get_stock_filings has the full list. - earnings: {next, last_reported}. next = the coming report date (estimated_date says whether the date can still move) with the consensus; last_reported = the newest reported quarter in the last 100 days with revenue, EPS and, where available, the beat or miss (eps_surprise). null when neither is known. - analyst_change: how consensus moved over the last 30 days - rating and mean target at th
